Supersedes the five-selector-only scope. Keep other SoCs and CPU identity
unchanged. Route format helpers, idle policy, PQ/CM/VADJ and LCD tails
through their existing pre-G12 implementations. Reject residual HDR2
writers, including exported/DV/PIP and histogram paths.

This is the user-requested full legacy comparison, not HDR color validation.
